<title>USA: DynCorp issues $100 million in 144A notes.</title>
<headline>DynCorp issues $100 million in 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following high-yield debt issue from DynCorp was priced in the 144A private placement market late on Tuesday, said market sources.</p>
<p>BT Securities Corp was lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>DynCorp is a high-technology services company.</p>
<p>BORROWER DYNCORP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 9.50 PCT   MATURITY 3/01/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 99.484  FIRST PAY DATE 9/01/97 LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 9.58 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD 300 BP     CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTE: Three year equity call for 35 percent at par plus coupon ((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1672))</p>
</text>
